DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_BDBD_B52D';
<p>bdbd_b52d</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #a32d36;">Gene A</span></strong> is correlated with the '<span style="color: #a32d36;"><i>artsy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #a32d36;">Gene A</span> has wings that are colorful and distinctive patterns.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #4b6924;">Gene B</span></strong> is connected with the '<span style="color: #4b6924;"><i>bumpy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #4b6924;">Gene B</span> has a skin texture that is not smooth, but rough with small bumps all over.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene E</span></strong> is correlated with the '<span style="color: #1d5bb5;"><i>eery</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene E</span> appears to have something off, crooked limbs and other twisted appendages.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, bumpy, eery</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e1f2c5; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">563</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, bumpy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e1f2c5; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,657</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy, eery</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #4b6924;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">6,649</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">artsy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe2e2; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">a</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #4b6924;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">75</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy, eery</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e1f2c5; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">74</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">bumpy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e1f2c5; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">b</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">6,628</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">eery</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #4b6924;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">e</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">2,782</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #a32d36;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #4b6924;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">572</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">20,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>A</b> and <b>B</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>A</b> and <b>B</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_BDBD_B52D
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(563 + 572 + 2,657 + 2,782)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>6,574</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.3287 = <strong>32.87 cM</strong>
LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(6,628 + 6,649)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>13,277</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.6639 = <strong>66.39 cM</strong>
LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(74 + 563 + 572 + 6,628)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>7,837</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.3918 = <strong>39.18 cM</strong>
LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(74 + 75 + 2,657 + 2,782)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>5,588</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.2794 = <strong>27.94 cM</strong>
LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(74 + 75 + 563 + 572)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>1,284</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.0642 = <strong>6.42 cM</strong>
LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(75 + 572 + 2,782 + 6,649)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>10,078</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.5039 = <strong>50.39 cM</strong>
LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(563 + 572 + 2,657 + 2,782)</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = <sup>6,574</sup>/<sub>20,000</sub> = 0.3287 = <strong>32.87 cM</strong>
LITERAL_BDBD_B52D_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

ENDDOCUMENT();
